    <item>
        <title>Kernel prepatch 7.3-rc7</title>
        <link>https://lwn.net/Articles/1099798/</link>
        <guid>https://lwn.net/Articles/1099798/</guid>
        <description>The &lt;a href="https://lwn.net/Articles/1099809/"&gt;7.3-rc7&lt;/a&gt; kernel prepatch is out for
testing.  According to Linus: "&lt;q&gt;As always, I would have preferred to see a smaller
rc, but it's not like anything in here looks like a reason to delay
the final release. So that's still set for next weekend unle</description>
        <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:31:34 +0000</pubDate>
        </item>
        <item>
        <title>Stable kernels 7.2.10 and 6.18.56</title>
        <link>https://lwn.net/Articles/1099764/</link>
        <guid>https://lwn.net/Articles/1099764/</guid>
        <description>The &lt;a href="https://lwn.net/Articles/1099765/"&gt;7.2.10&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a
href="https://lwn.net/Articles/1099766/"&gt;6.18.56&lt;/a&gt; stable kernels have been released.
Each contains another several hundred important fixes.</description>
